    <title>
        ByteLib Loader
    </title>
    <primary-label ref="subject-to-change"/>
    <p>The ByteLib
        <tooltip term="loader">loader</tooltip>
        is responsible for loading ByteLib's dependencies for plugins using
        it to operate. You should've configured your plugin to use it in the <a href="Bootstrapping.topic">previous
            topic</a>.
    </p>
    <p>Currently, the loader is
        <emphasis>not configurable</emphasis>
        , but it is also
