        to use it. The loader is defined as follows:
    </p>
    <include from="code_snippets.topic" element-id="bytelib-loader"/>
    <p>If you need or want to use your own loader, as long as it includes those two dependencies, then you do not have
        to use the
        included one. The loader is only called by Paper, ByteLib does not do anything with it itself.</p>

